      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:105%">Evergreen - 25 Year costs related to 18,256 Dth per day of vintage capacity are not included. The total cost of service related to the vintage capacity is approximately $1.7 million.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">The information contained on this page excludes regulatory assets. See FERC Form 2, page 232 - "Other Regulatory Assets (Account 182.3)" for this additional information.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">* This project has an additional incremental fuel rate. We retained 106,035 Dth of gas from our shippers in 2025.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Northwest uses the Fixed Asset Method to report storage.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This account captures storage encroachments on Northwest&#8217;s fixed asset system balancing gas recorded in account 117.2. Northwest debits 808.1 and credits 117.4 for any net shortage of supplied gas and debits 117.4 and credits 808.2 for any net excess of supplied gas.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The gas inventory balance is classified to account 164.1. Gas is withdrawn from this account for expansion projects and to replace gas lost or used during maintenance work.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
